> read folio
Inscribed in your mentor's familiar, frantic handwriting is a harrowing log of
his forbidden studies.

He writes that the present age will soon give way to an era of terror and dread,
heralded by the return of the Old Gods to the Earth. It would mean nothing less
than the annihilation of humanity. Ever since his exile from the Academy he has
searched, without rest, for a way to delay the waking of these malevolent
powers.

There is but one hope. By opening a gateway to a higher dimension, he can
channel a torrent of pure, white magic powerful enough to seal the evil gods
away. To tear open this gate, however, he requires four elemental stones. He
already possesses the first, a dark, abyssal stone, and he needs your help to
unearth the remaining three.

